          "description": "Settle a private swap: verify proof → host recompute → nullifiers + reserves.\n\nTransparent analog: `crates/dex` `ExecuteMsg::Swap { offer_asset, max_spread, ... }`\nbut offer is a **proven note spend**, not a bank push.",
